<title>USA: Wedding Information distributes shares.</title>
<headline>Wedding Information distributes shares.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wedding Information Network Inc said Thursday it distributed 675,000 shares of common stock to fulfill obligations for a stock purchase agreement made in November 1991.</p>
<p>This increases the number of common shares to 3,989,575 from 3,314,575, representing a dilution of about 20 percent.</p>
<p>It said no other obligations for stock distribution exist outside of the company stock option plan, which has granted options to purchase 394,000 shares at prices ranging from $0.10 to $2 a share.</p>
<p>Wedding Information Network's stock ended at $0.30, up $0.02. The company publishes a wedding planner.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
